    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge tons of missiles flying at you. Practice your reactions, memorize the structure of the maps and adapt to the ever-changing rules on them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288650/extras/4930ca5930c6ef92c78bfaf0c466e502.poster.avif?t=1742910733\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288650/extras/4930ca5930c6ef92c78bfaf0c466e502.webm?t=1742910733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288650/extras/4930ca5930c6ef92c78bfaf0c466e502.mp4?t=1742910733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique levels, which in addition to a unique mood and visuals may have \u201cfun\u201d features. A deadly circular saw attached to another saw that's attached to an even bigger saw? We have that. Or a level that forces you to jump on flying cars, from one to another, and pray that you don't fall to the bottom from a height of more than 200 meters above the ground? And how about a l\u0305\u033bevel\u0312\u0328 w\u0357ith\u030c\u0339 \u0305c\u035b\u0325u\u0344r\u0311\u0318s\u0311e\u0352d\u030c\u035a \u0360\u0347b\u030c\u033a\u035c\u0322\u0325l\u030c\u0324\u031f\u035c\u0330a\u0357\u030c\u0313\u0331c\u030f\u0351\u0354\u0332\u033a\u0330k\u0310\u0345\u0316\u0333\u032a \u035d\u0344\u034b\u032eh\u030e\u034e\u0349\u0319\u0326o\u0343\u0343\u0325l\u0358\u0350\u0315\u0345\u034e\u0328\u0356e\u033e\u0339\u0325s\u034a\u032f\u0324\u0347 \u0300\u0309\u0316\u035a\u0353\u0330t\u0338\u0344\u033d\u0360h\u0338\u035d\u0305\u0312\u030f\u031c\u0317\u0332\u0327\u0359\u0328a\u0336\u030c\u0313\u034b3\u0336\u032b\u0339\u033b\u0349\u0309\u0308^\u0337\u0354\u0332\u0332\u033a\u0342\u030c\u0358\u0360\u035d$\u0338\u034d\u030f\u0350)\u0334\u0321\u031d\u0324\u0323\u0305\u030a</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 types of crosses (missiles), extremely different from each other and requiring a unique approach. Will you be able to survive in a hell where all of them are mixed on one screen and won't stop appearing? It depends only on your persistence!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of different skins that add beautiful effects on top of the new look. Unlock new skins for completing levels and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288650/extras/459f16cc185e75e1f733d0185c077ef7.poster.avif?t=1742910733\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288650/extras/459f16cc185e75e1f733d0185c077ef7.webm?t=1742910733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288650/extras/459f16cc185e75e1f733d0185c077ef7.mp4?t=1742910733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass levels, break records, and don't look for a story in the game. There is no story.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge tons of missiles flying at you. Practice your reactions, memorize the structure of the maps and adapt to the ever-changing rules on them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288650/extras/4930ca5930c6ef92c78bfaf0c466e502.poster.avif?t=1742910733\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288650/extras/4930ca5930c6ef92c78bfaf0c466e502.webm?t=1742910733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288650/extras/4930ca5930c6ef92c78bfaf0c466e502.mp4?t=1742910733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique levels, which in addition to a unique mood and visuals may have \u201cfun\u201d features. A deadly circular saw attached to another saw that's attached to an even bigger saw? We have that. Or a level that forces you to jump on flying cars, from one to another, and pray that you don't fall to the bottom from a height of more than 200 meters above the ground? And how about a l\u0305\u033bevel\u0312\u0328 w\u0357ith\u030c\u0339 \u0305c\u035b\u0325u\u0344r\u0311\u0318s\u0311e\u0352d\u030c\u035a \u0360\u0347b\u030c\u033a\u035c\u0322\u0325l\u030c\u0324\u031f\u035c\u0330a\u0357\u030c\u0313\u0331c\u030f\u0351\u0354\u0332\u033a\u0330k\u0310\u0345\u0316\u0333\u032a \u035d\u0344\u034b\u032eh\u030e\u034e\u0349\u0319\u0326o\u0343\u0343\u0325l\u0358\u0350\u0315\u0345\u034e\u0328\u0356e\u033e\u0339\u0325s\u034a\u032f\u0324\u0347 \u0300\u0309\u0316\u035a\u0353\u0330t\u0338\u0344\u033d\u0360h\u0338\u035d\u0305\u0312\u030f\u031c\u0317\u0332\u0327\u0359\u0328a\u0336\u030c\u0313\u034b3\u0336\u032b\u0339\u033b\u0349\u0309\u0308^\u0337\u0354\u0332\u0332\u0